07:30.940 --> 07:32.648
Zoom in the night like shhh
on a mission

07:32.732 --> 07:34.148
Cape in the wind,
no fear, no permission

07:34.232 --> 07:35.898
Took that hit?
Man, still I'm rise

07:35.940 --> 07:37.398
Talk that talk,
but I live with precision.

07:37.482 --> 07:38.982
Mask on face like a ghost in the mist

07:39.065 --> 07:40.690
One clean punch,
now your crew don't exist

07:40.773 --> 07:42.315
