Yuck!

08:35.440 --> 08:36.732
Why do you do it?

08:36.940 --> 08:39.648
Honestly, some people make you wonder
why they died.

08:41.732 --> 08:43.440
Then there are others

08:43.898 --> 08:45.148
you wonder why they're still around.

08:45.982 --> 08:47.023
What happened?

08:47.857 --> 08:50.107
I was fighting with ten people alone,

08:50.357 --> 08:52.065
while he was enjoying the view.

08:53.023 --> 08:55.232
Brothers like you don't belong
in this world--

08:56.357 --> 08:57.607
They belong in an underwear.

08:57.690 --> 08:58.940
Where? In an underwear?

09:00.107 --> 09:02.107
I should have been in an underwear?
What is he saying?

09:02.190 --> 09:03.690
It's okay, calm down.
It's okay.

09:03.773 --> 09:05.148
What can I say, sir?

09:05.315 --> 09:06.690
Do you know what happened last night?

09:06.815 --> 09:08.565
Take a look.
See...

09:44.148 --> 09:45.940
Usually, it takes two to fight...

09:46.815 --> 09:48.232
But you are throwing punches all alone.

09:48.398 --> 09:49.940
So, who exactly are you fighting?

09:51.482 --> 09:53.940
The accident and near death experience

09:54.982 --> 09:57.690
has severely affected your brain.

09:57.940 --> 10:01.940
What you think is real,
are actually hallucinations!

10:02.857 --> 10:04.107
A figment of your imagination.

10:04.232 --> 10:06.107
What about these bruises
I got during the fight?

10:07.357 --> 10:08.565
Is this also my imagination?

10:23.315 --> 10:27.440
Ronny... even I want all this
to be a dream.

10:28.190 --> 10:29.440
I just hope everything goes
back to normal

10:29.523 --> 10:32.357
and nothing ever goes wrong with you.

10:32.940 --> 10:34.107
That's all.

10:35.190 --> 10:36.732
If all this is a dream,

10:37.898 --> 10:40.023
then I'm happy living
in my hallucination.

10:56.148 --> 10:57.565
Oh, my God.

11:12.440 --> 11:13.440
