post his accident.

11:47.190 --> 11:48.482
Someone called Alisha.

11:50.815 --> 11:52.648
But there is no record of this Alisha.

11:52.773 --> 11:55.357
No Pan Card, Aadhar Card,
Ration Card or passport...

11:55.482 --> 11:56.482
Nothing.

11:56.607 --> 11:58.898
