11:58.982 --> 12:00.232
I would have met her atleast once.

12:03.482 --> 12:09.857
My love... if you're not mine,
I'll have no reason to live.

12:12.523 --> 12:17.107
Sir, I think this Alisha only exists
in his mind.

12:18.440 --> 12:20.982
