25:21.315 --> 25:22.440
I will shoot you.
Throw it down.

25:22.982 --> 25:24.440
Ronny... please...

25:24.523 --> 25:25.940
Throw down the hammer, brother.

25:25.982 --> 25:26.898
They are the cops, they will shoot!

25:26.940 --> 25:28.065
Throw it down.

25:28.398 --> 25:29.398
Throw it down!

25:31.357 --> 25:32.357
Sir, sorry. Sorry.

25:32.440 --> 25:34.190
