25:34.273 --> 25:36.398
I apologise. Please forgive him.

25:36.523 --> 25:37.815
Ronny, stop.

25:37.898 --> 25:40.315
Sir, please. Ronny.

25:40.440 --> 25:41.898
What are you doing?

25:41.940 --> 25:43.065
Ronny, stop it.

25:43.148 --> 25:45.940
