Ronny no!

25:49.023 --> 25:50.315
He attacked the ACP...

25:51.398 --> 25:53.148
This is my introduction,

25:53.357 --> 25:54.940
why do you get to throw the punch?

25:55.190 --> 25:56.107
Hit me. Come on.

25:56.648 --> 25:58.398
Hit me.

25:58.523 --> 25:59.398
He will hit him.

25:59.482 --> 26:00.982
I know it.

26:02.648 --> 26:04.773
He hit me.

26:08.732 --> 26:11.940
Your fingerprints are now
printed on my forehead.

26:12.398 --> 26:14.315
Now watch my magic fingres.

26:27.023 --> 26:30.190
Sir, can you stop tapping
on the table, please?

26:30.273 --> 26:31.273
Why?

26:31.773 --> 26:33.523
- Is it irritating?
- No...

26:34.190 --> 26:36.940
I've had this habit...
Since childhood.

26:37.440 --> 26:40.398
I am always tapping on something.

26:42.065 --> 26:43.815
Of course, you are amazing at it.
Like a pro.

26:43.940 --> 26:45.023
- Like it?
- Yes.

26:47.232 --> 26:48.148
Get talking.

26:49.232 --> 26:50.482
What is the problem here?

26:51.440 --> 26:53.398
- Is it property?
- No, sir.

26:53.857 --> 26:54.940
Kute...

26:55.565 --> 26:58.398
At this age, hormones run wild

26:58.565 --> 27:00.273
each pulling in different direction.

27:02.273 --> 27:03.440
All this for a girl?

27:03.523 --> 27:05.482
There is no girl, sir--

27:07.273 --> 27:09.357
Low... keep it down...

27:09.940 --> 27:11.648
Volume low...

27:12.398 --> 27:14.440
- Am I not being polite?
- Yes, sir.

27:14.523 --> 27:16.148
Talk like me.

27:17.148 --> 27:18.982
- There is no girl--
- Hey!

27:19.190 --> 27:21.357
In your own voice... low...

27:21.482 --> 27:23.190
Low volume in my own voice?
Got it.

27:23.523 --> 27:26.773
Speaking in low volume,
there is no girl, sir...

27:26.898 --> 27:28.065
There is a girl.

27:29.357 --> 27:32.523
How else can you explain her
dead body?

27:33.232 --> 27:34.065
Sir...

27:34.148 --> 27:35.315
It's okay, it's all good.

27:36.148 --> 27:36.940
Wait...

27:38.107 --> 27:39.107
what body?

27:40.065 --> 27:41.107
And whose body?

27:44.107 --> 27:45.107
Kute...

27:45.232 --> 27:46.982
He said one body.

27:47.523 --> 27:48.940
But everyone here is a dead body.

27:48.982 --> 27:50.273
Yes, sir.

27:52.315 --> 27:53.440
She's my Alisha.

27:53.607 --> 27:54.523
Her?

27:55.815 --> 27:56.815
Wow!

27:58.982 --> 28:00.023
Girlfriend?

28:01.232 --> 28:02.107
Nice.

28:02.648 --> 28:05.732
Come, son. Take a look.

28:13.857 --> 28:15.065
Aged girlfriend?

28:17.565 --> 28:18.773
How is this possible?

28:21.232 --> 28:22.440
Who is Margaret?

28:23.398 --> 28:25.273
This is Alisha's grave.

28:25.398 --> 28:28.482
Is this a grave or a parcel
which got switched?

28:28.565 --> 28:31.232
Believe me... it's Alisha's grave.

28:31.482 --> 28:32.482
See.

28:33.315 --> 28:34.773
I wrote this.

28:34.857 --> 28:35.940
- For Alisha!
- Okay.

28:36.023 --> 28:37.732
You wrote this on Alisha's grave.

28:37.815 --> 28:40.273
How did it end up on
Margaret's grave?

28:40.357 --> 28:42.940
- Must be one of his plans!
- Mine?

28:43.023 --> 28:45.565
- I've never been here in my life.
- Enough! Relax.

28:46.232 --> 28:49.732
Kute... no girl, no body, no grave.

28:50.065 --> 28:52.273
Pinch me. Am I even here?

28:52.398 --> 28:53.940
Believe me, sir.

28:54.232 --> 28:56.148
Why would anyone lie about
a dead person?

28:56.232 --> 28:58.357
Then tell us the truth...

28:58.940 --> 29:00.898
- Are you two brothers trying to...
- Sir!

29:01.023 --> 29:03.065
Con the police?

29:03.148 --> 29:03.940
Sir, no.

29:03.982 --> 29:05.232
- He has nothing better to do.
- Wait, sir.

29:06.148 --> 29:07.440
Hey, Ronny. What happened?

29:07.523 --> 29:09.065
- Please come with me.
- Is the police with you?

29:09.148 --> 29:10.773
Yes. Just come with me.

29:11.023 --> 29:11.940
Who is she?

29:12.982 --> 29:13.940
Come.

29:15.315 --> 29:17.440
Aunty, tell them that
I come here every day.

29:18.190 --> 29:19.940
Yes. He does.

29:20.065 --> 29:21.065
You see, aunty.

29:21.148 --> 29:24.398
He says this grave belongs to his Alisha.

29:24.523 --> 29:27.773
But it belongs to this old lady -
Margaret.

29:27.940 --> 29:30.523
I see him coming here every day
for the past few months.

29:30.607 --> 29:33.440
- He sits in front of this grave.
- Oh!

29:33.523 --> 29:35.065
I thought...

29:35.523 --> 29:37.607
it was his mother's grave.

29:38.857 --> 29:40.065
Margaret!

29:40.190 --> 29:41.357
Oh!

29:46.857 --> 29:47.898
- Hey...
- You're lying.

29:47.940 --> 29:50.565
- How can you lie?
- Leave her. Let her go.

29:50.648 --> 29:52.315
How can you lie?

29:52.982 --> 29:54.273
Ronny, leave her.
What are you doing?

29:54.357 --> 29:55.440
- Leave her.
- Leave me!

29:57.065 --> 29:58.940
Bunch of liars all of you.

29:58.982 --> 30:00.523
Why would I lie?

30:01.190 --> 30:02.273
Where is Alisha?

30:03.065 --> 30:03.940
Alisha...

30:04.023 --> 30:05.148
- Ronny.
- Alisha!

30:05.273 --> 30:06.232
Ronny.

30:11.065 --> 30:13.065
I told you he hallucinates.

30:13.190 --> 30:14.940
He's searching for
a girl that doesn't exist.

30:14.982 --> 30:16.398
Let him look.

30:16.482 --> 30:18.273
He'll either find the girl,

30:18.940 --> 30:20.982
or the truth!

30:35.607 --> 30:40.773
Don't know why...
But you look beautiful to me.

30:40.857 --> 30:46.940
Don't know why...
But you look beautiful to me.

31:08.898 --> 31:11.440
My new phone!

31:32.023 --> 31:35.815
Oh no... I haven't even
paid the first EMI yet.

31:37.607 --> 31:38.898
And you broke it.

31:38.940 --> 31:40.065
Listen, I am really sorry.

31:40.148 --> 31:41.940
It happens on the job.
Collateral damage.

31:42.357 --> 31:44.690
Phone is my lifeline.

31:45.023 --> 31:46.940
It's a matter of life and death.

31:47.773 --> 31:49.815
How will I survive without my phone?

31:49.940 --> 31:51.732
Stop crying over your phone.

31:51.815 --> 31:55.065
A junkie was getting away
and you were busy making reels.

31:55.690 --> 31:58.190
Gen Zs these days are like zombies.

31:58.773 --> 32:01.732
if you stay off social media for a day...

32:01.898 --> 32:04.857
It won't matter to anyone except you.

32:05.232 --> 32:07.815
But it will matter to the society

32:07.898 --> 32:10.023
if you don't do your
social responsibility!

32:14.940 --> 32:15.773
Hey!

32:15.815 --> 32:18.482
Can you two stop
this love connection of yours.

32:18.565 --> 32:20.065
I am getting electrocuted.

32:21.940 --> 32:22.398
Come on.

32:22.523 --> 32:23.898
How long can you escape defensive forces?

32:23.982 --> 32:25.065
And one more thing...

32:25.773 --> 32:28.398
Men in uniform never
let civilians suffer any losses.

32:28.815 --> 32:29.815
Understand?

32:30.065 --> 32:32.148
They always think of their safety.

32:33.857 --> 32:36.523
You'll get your lifeline back
when I get my next salary.

32:37.065 --> 32:38.607
Until then, you can keep my phone.

32:38.690 --> 32:40.857
I will deactivate my E-sim.

32:47.815 --> 32:49.273
How are you going to return it?

32:49.982 --> 32:51.940
When these eyes can locate the enemy--

32:55.273 --> 32:56.940
I am sure finding
a phone will be easy.

33:00.523 --> 33:03.690
Alisha, your phone's gone.

33:03.898 --> 33:04.815
What about your sister?

33:04.898 --> 33:06.190
Oh no!

33:06.273 --> 33:07.565
Sister's going to kill me.

33:07.648 --> 33:09.023
Alisha!

33:09.107 --> 33:11.023
I just bought you a new phone.

33:11.107 --> 33:12.023
What is wrong with you?

33:12.107 --> 33:13.357
I've been trying to call you.

33:13.440 --> 33:14.857
Why is your phone off?

33:14.940 --> 33:16.023
It's broken.

33:16.565 --> 33:17.940
He broke it.

33:18.773 --> 33:19.690
Who did?

33:19.773 --> 33:20.690
I know it was you.

33:20.773 --> 33:21.940
You are very mischievous.

33:22.023 --> 33:22.773
Did you break it?

33:22.857 --> 33:24.315
Sister, please.

33:24.440 --> 33:27.440
He showed me all his sides
in under fifteen minutes...

33:27.940 --> 33:31.398
Anger. Bravery. Attitude.

33:31.982 --> 33:34.815
And his statements hit like
a bombardment.

33:35.857 --> 33:38.815
He's an officer of the Defence Sea-Forces.

33:55.107 --> 33:59.898
Alisha, men are the biggest pain
in a woman's life.

33:59.982 --> 34:02.190
Men keep one women in their heart,

34:02.273 --> 34:03.857
another in their mind

34:03.898 --> 34:05.273
and one in their house.

34:05.357 --> 34:07.982
And they keep the likes of you
in delusion.

34:08.065 --> 34:11.482
Our foster homes are always full
because of men like them.

34:11.648 --> 34:13.440
You know you don't know.
You understand...

34:13.523 --> 34:14.898
I don't want to know anything.

34:14.940 --> 34:16.523
I just want my phone back.

34:17.107 --> 34:18.648
Come on. Eat.
What are you listening?

34:18.898 --> 34:19.940
You too.

34:20.065 --> 34:21.232
By the way, sister.

34:21.315 --> 34:22.898
When do these officers get their salary?

34:22.982 --> 34:23.898
I don't know!

34:23.982 --> 34:26.607
But I do know you won't get your salary,

34:26.690 --> 34:27.815
because look at the time.

34:27.898 --> 34:29.107
You're still not gone.

34:29.315 --> 34:30.857
- Stop thinking about him.
- I am going.

34:30.898 --> 34:31.898
You don't know anything about him.

34:31.940 --> 34:32.940
I am going.
Bye.

34:33.023 --> 34:33.607
Drink your milk, son.

34:33.690 --> 34:34.815
You haven't been drinking
your milk for two days.

34:34.898 --> 34:36.398
- Cheers.
- Cheers.

34:38.898 --> 34:39.982
Boss...

34:49.898 --> 34:52.398
Who's the guy
that's lost the will to live?

34:52.482 --> 34:53.648
That's the guy, boss.

34:55.273 --> 34:56.565
Don't follow me.

34:57.065 --> 34:59.148
Boss. He's the one.

34:59.398 --> 35:00.565
Cheers.

35:02.565 --> 35:04.232
In front of boss, no drinking.

35:05.898 --> 35:07.315
I see... another one.

35:09.107 --> 35:10.107
He'll open that one too.

35:10.857 --> 35:12.107
And I'll grab it.

35:12.690 --> 35:13.690
Me too.

35:15.607 --> 35:16.607
Boss...

35:16.857 --> 35:18.357
Hold on.
Hello...

35:18.565 --> 35:22.148
Don't mistake me for a junk collector
collecting bottles.

35:22.273 --> 35:23.440
Aren't you ashamed...

35:23.565 --> 35:25.982
Calling a bazooka to kill a mosquito.

35:26.065 --> 35:27.565
He's not a mosquito.

35:27.690 --> 35:29.565
Do you have blood pressure?

35:29.690 --> 35:30.607
Or take any other pill.

35:30.690 --> 35:32.815
Finish your beer quickly.

35:32.898 --> 35:34.440
Once Pali starts punching,

35:34.565 --> 35:36.023
there are no breaks for drink...

35:36.107 --> 35:37.357
Only broken bones.

35:37.440 --> 35:38.357
Yeah.

35:39.940 --> 35:42.273
Bro, listen I was on duty the other day

35:42.565 --> 35:44.148
today is my day off, so...

35:44.648 --> 35:45.940
I'm in no mood to fight.

35:46.107 --> 35:47.148
But I am.

35:47.232 --> 35:48.440
Because when someone got
in the mood,

35:48.565 --> 35:49.565
I came to this world.

35:49.648 --> 35:52.065
That's why I am always in the mood.

35:52.607 --> 35:54.398
Okay, look.
I come here every day,

35:54.482 --> 35:57.440
and I don't want to tear
this place apart, so...

35:57.565 --> 35:58.607
Let's go outside.

35:58.815 --> 36:01.190
He's reminded me of
my childhood days.

36:01.440 --> 36:04.482
As a kid I would make similar excuses

36:04.690 --> 36:06.690
when I knew I was going
to get a beating.

36:06.773 --> 36:07.690
My son.

36:07.857 --> 36:09.023
I feel you, bro.

36:09.107 --> 36:09.857
Come out.

36:09.898 --> 36:11.273
Bring him out.
Come out.

36:11.607 --> 36:12.815
Come on.

36:12.898 --> 36:13.898
Hurry up.

36:13.982 --> 36:15.190
You were giving me such attitude.

36:15.315 --> 36:17.148
Look... that's my gang.

36:19.940 --> 36:21.357
Boys, attack.

36:22.815 --> 36:23.565
Go on!

36:27.273 --> 36:30.232
Calm down!
It's just a broken right elbow.

36:31.107 --> 36:32.898
It will be okay in three weeks.
Okay.

36:33.732 --> 36:34.982
But your effort was a waste.

36:35.107 --> 36:36.690
He's a lefty.

36:37.815 --> 36:39.482
- Is it?
- Yes.

36:44.148 --> 36:44.940
Sorry.

36:49.857 --> 36:50.898
Come on.

36:51.815 --> 36:52.857
Oh No!

36:52.898 --> 36:54.857
It's just a broken knee.

36:56.065 --> 36:58.190
In two weeks... it'll be okay.

36:58.440 --> 37:00.107
You should be glad
that you won't have to

37:00.273 --> 37:02.148
go down on your knees anymore.

37:02.273 --> 37:03.023
Go on.

37:03.273 --> 37:05.523
Beat him.

37:09.357 --> 37:12.273
Did you come to fight him or scare me?

37:12.357 --> 37:13.607
Get lost.

37:15.523 --> 37:16.648
Idiot...

37:17.482 --> 37:18.523
Beat him.

37:20.398 --> 37:21.940
It's not over yet.

37:26.898 --> 37:28.523
You did what you had to.

37:28.732 --> 37:30.148
Now, it's my turn.

37:30.232 --> 37:32.357
If you have...

37:32.523 --> 37:35.023
any respect for old folks,

37:35.273 --> 37:37.940
then please don't beat me up
in front of my boys

37:38.023 --> 37:40.023
Give me your address.
I'll come there.

37:40.107 --> 37:42.565
But you said,
you don't need a bazooka...

37:42.648 --> 37:45.940
No, no, I said we don't need a grandpa!

37:46.023 --> 37:47.148
Is it?

37:48.065 --> 37:50.023
Look, I got to break something.

37:50.190 --> 37:51.648
I know - you tell me what I can break.

37:51.773 --> 37:52.982
Must break something?

37:53.440 --> 37:55.148
I need this and this.

37:55.232 --> 37:56.232
And this...

37:58.440 --> 38:00.023
I know...
You can break my nose.

38:00.107 --> 38:01.565
I can breathe even from my mouth.

38:01.648 --> 38:02.898
- You're right about that.
- Thank you.

38:05.065 --> 38:06.023
- Sir.
- Yes.

38:06.107 --> 38:08.107
I've never seen someone beat a guy up

38:08.190 --> 38:09.940
and then take him to the hospital.

38:10.107 --> 38:11.732
Can you beat him up some more?

38:11.857 --> 38:13.607
Otherwise... the guys
at the hospital won't take him in.

38:13.732 --> 38:16.982
Is is your dad's college
that they won't admit me?

38:19.482 --> 38:20.482
Sir...

38:20.565 --> 38:22.857
Sir... I've admitted all of them.

38:23.773 --> 38:24.732
- Thank you.
- Okay.

38:32.398 --> 38:33.857
Again on the phone.

38:34.232 --> 38:36.732
This Gen Z will never learn.

38:37.357 --> 38:39.565
Dr. Alisha. They are calling you.

39:31.732 --> 39:32.857
Call the doctor.

39:32.898 --> 39:34.648
- She's coming. She's coming.
- Why is she walking in slo-mo?

39:34.732 --> 39:36.023
Dr Alisha.

39:36.440 --> 39:38.357
Do you come here to attend the patients

39:38.440 --> 39:39.648
or attend your phone?

39:39.773 --> 39:40.482
Hold on.

39:40.565 --> 39:44.648
There are other patients
like you who need me.

39:44.898 --> 39:48.398
Without this phone,
I can not get to them on time.

39:48.732 --> 39:51.107
That's why this phone is my lifeline.

39:52.107 --> 39:53.773
Again with the phone.

39:53.857 --> 39:56.440
Buried in your phone all day
with your head bowed down.

40:03.982 --> 40:05.898
You? Doctor?

40:06.273 --> 40:07.648
This is not rented.

40:08.523 --> 40:10.607
I also have a degree.

40:11.440 --> 40:12.648
I am sorry.

40:13.857 --> 40:15.440
I shouldn't have called you Gen Z.

40:15.982 --> 40:18.482
I tend to get a little serious on duty.

40:18.648 --> 40:20.273
And we have to be calm,

40:20.440 --> 40:21.982
or the patient gets serious.

40:22.065 --> 40:23.190
Patient serious?

40:23.273 --> 40:25.232
- Is my condition too serious?
- No...

40:25.315 --> 40:26.398
You're bleeding.

40:26.482 --> 40:30.607
Bleeding?
That rascal hit me really hard.

40:32.982 --> 40:34.190
When did I get hurt?

40:34.315 --> 40:35.773
It can be dangerous.

40:35.982 --> 40:39.357
Dangerous?
Oh, God. I am doomed.

40:39.440 --> 40:40.398
I am okay.

40:40.565 --> 40:41.898
Is someone with you?

40:41.982 --> 40:42.940
Family?

40:43.023 --> 40:45.898
I was orphaned even before I was born.

40:45.940 --> 40:47.940
Why don't you give me
the bad news once and for all.

40:48.023 --> 40:49.023
Keep lying down.

40:49.107 --> 40:50.190
Please come with me.

40:50.273 --> 40:51.148
I am not going anywhere.

40:51.232 --> 40:53.023
- Do what you want here.
- Stop. Okay.

40:53.273 --> 40:54.732
You'll start bleeding
from the other nose.

40:54.857 --> 40:56.023
Stop screaming.

40:58.857 --> 41:00.357
By the way,
I am sorry for your phone.

41:01.232 --> 41:03.523
It's getting fixed.
I'll return it as soon as I get it.

41:03.732 --> 41:04.648
It's okay.

41:06.190 --> 41:08.898
Now, let me just see this, please.

41:11.773 --> 41:12.898
Five mm.

41:13.190 --> 41:16.190
Any further and it could have
damaged the arteries.

41:16.565 --> 41:18.315
You've got laceration at neck.

41:18.565 --> 41:19.565
Don't worry.

41:20.148 --> 41:22.148
Keep the moment of your neck limited.

41:22.815 --> 41:24.815
And we're keeping you overnight
at the hospital

41:24.857 --> 41:27.023
just to make sure that you're stable...

41:27.232 --> 41:28.773
And to run some tests.

41:29.940 --> 41:31.107
You'll be fine?

41:31.732 --> 41:32.607
Are you sure?

41:32.732 --> 41:35.898
Even doctors wear a uniform.

41:35.940 --> 41:38.023
Please, just do as you've been told.

41:43.023 --> 41:43.898
I'll be right back.

41:44.398 --> 41:45.190
Listen, mister.

41:45.273 --> 41:46.107
Is Dr Alisha coming?

41:46.190 --> 41:47.232
She will

41:47.315 --> 41:48.315
if there is an emergency.

41:48.440 --> 41:49.523
Why didn't you say this before?

41:49.607 --> 41:51.232
- What?
- Emergency!

41:54.898 --> 41:55.857
Doctor!

41:55.898 --> 41:57.023
Emergency!

42:03.565 --> 42:05.482
If shedding blood is your thing,

42:05.607 --> 42:06.982
you should donate some of it.

42:07.065 --> 42:09.273
It can save someone's life.

42:11.940 --> 42:14.773
Men in uniform are very responsible.

42:15.107 --> 42:16.065
But you...

42:16.648 --> 42:18.523
beat up people on the streets.

42:20.107 --> 42:21.773
When we see injustice being done,

42:22.357 --> 42:24.315
we don't care if we're on the streets
or the border?

42:25.773 --> 42:27.440
And anyway...
there's something about me

42:27.648 --> 42:29.648
that protects me from every danger.

42:30.357 --> 42:31.898
Like my inner voice,

42:32.065 --> 42:33.898
sixth sense, or...

42:33.982 --> 42:35.023
Intuition!

42:36.107 --> 42:37.357
Is it?

42:37.607 --> 42:41.148
What happened to your intuition
when you got hurt?

42:41.273 --> 42:42.273
It did help.

42:42.523 --> 42:45.065
The guys I beat up,
I brought them to the hospital.

42:45.482 --> 42:46.648
In the hospital, I saw you.

42:46.898 --> 42:50.107
You saw my cut
and my intuition saved me.

42:50.982 --> 42:53.482
Those who beat you up rarely
come back to help.

42:54.107 --> 42:55.190
Wow!

42:58.023 --> 43:02.232
Did your intuition also tell you
that you are going to get injected?

43:02.732 --> 43:07.898
