01:46:52.732 --> 01:46:54.232
I never miss the aim,

01:46:54.315 --> 01:46:56.107
These guns aren't bought,

01:46:56.190 --> 01:46:57.773
They're part
of the family's name.

01:46:57.857 --> 01:47:01.148
Not every matter
to my boss is escalated by me,

