01:50:11.357 --> 01:50:13.148
Because God is on leave.

01:50:13.273 --> 01:50:14.107
What?

01:50:14.440 --> 01:50:18.148
What is God's role
in the devil's love story?

01:50:19.315 --> 01:50:20.523
Tell me...

01:50:21.398 --> 01:50:22.523
